WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:10.335
Today the catalogue holds 3 531 pieces of Fengyun-1C, and 2 310 are still up, nearly twenty years on.

00:10.852 --> 00:14.969
On 10 November 2021 the station moved again to dodge one.

00:15.476 --> 00:16.596
The counts are measured.

00:17.005 --> 00:22.766
The picture is a model: today's survivors on today's orbits, spread back to the moment of the test.
